--- !u!114 &652085208
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 652085203}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 263574e455f1f2c4aa0d82f729cb6776, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  textComponent: {fileID: 1518463088}
  lines:
  - 'Mandyangan: *Pants and wheezes* Whew, that was close. If we had fled any second
    later we would''ve been surrounded!'
  - 'Steve: *Shakily* I can''t thank you enough for saving me! I''m Steve, what''s
    your name?'
  - 'Manny: The name''s Manny!'
  - 'Patroller Dwende: A-HEM'
  - 'Steve & Manny: *Startled* Oh, hello there!'
  - 'Patroller Dwende: You two seem capable and... relatively good natured. Why don''t
    you help us out?'
  - 'Steve: Oh, what do you need help with?'
  - 'Patroller Dwende: Several citizens nearby are in need of assistance. Unfortunately,
    we don''t have good communication lines up here in the mountains - but the leads
    we do have on those who need our help are on the board right over here.'
  - 'Patroller Dwende: I heard there are several MASSIVE creatures posing a catastrophic
    risk to the nearby communities. If you manage to get enough clues about their
    whereabouts, you might be able to find them and get rid of them for us - hopefully
    for good.'
  - 'Manny: I''m glad to help and all, but Steve here is just a human. He might not
    survive any catastrophic risks... and anyway, this is all so sudden to spring
    on us. We just got here!'
  - 'Steve: ...'
  - 'Steve: I''m in.'
  - 'Patroller Dwende & Manny: Wh-what?'
  - 'Steve: I said I''m in. I had a dream of needing to be in these mountains a week
    ago. I''ve been trying to piece together why I had that dream ever since - and
    why I''ve felt that I was needed here.'
  - 'Steve: I think this is why. Let me help you find these catastrophic risks, Manny.'
  - 'Manny: Are you sure? It''ll be very dangerous!'
  - 'Steve: I''m absolutely sure. Now, let''s take a look at the board for any leads!'
  - 'Manny: It''ll be a pleasure working with you, Steve! Let''s save some hides!'
  - 'Patroller Dwende: When you''re ready, approach the nearby bulletin board and
    press "F".'
  textInterval: 0.03
  pointer: {fileID: 474707155}
  HUD: {fileID: 0}
