--- !u!114 &1355579866
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1355579864}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b8a436112f3669a4d841b19682c99fb4, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  textComponent: {fileID: 606871231}
  lines:
  - 'Unusually Large Dwende: *In very deep voice* Hi.'
  - 'Steve: Uh... hi?'
  - 'Manny: Oh uhm, Hello... you''re huge.'
  - 'Steve: *Whispers* shhh Manny don''t just blurt it out!'
  - 'Steve: He uh, he means you''re unusually well-endowed, Mr. Dwende sir.'
  - 'Unusually Large Dwende: It''s okay, I know I''m bigger than other dwendes. Anyway,
    if you two want to get as big and strong as me, you should go check out the two
    unique buildings around these ruins. You can use your spoils of battle to buy
    skills and equip the ones you want to use from those buildings.'
  - 'Unusually Large Dwende: The obelisk is for you, big guy. The shrine is more
    for humans - so that''s where you get your skills, human.'
  - 'Unusually Large Dwende: Don''t forget to collect enough spoils. I think there
    are too many KAPRE CIGARS out there. I can smell the smoke all the way from here.
    You should collect those to offer in exchange for skills.'
  - 'Steve & Manny: Thank you so much!'
  - 'Unusually Large Dwende: You''re welcome. Bathala rewards those who do his bidding.
    Those kapres are an evil bunch.'
  textInterval: 0.03
  pointer: {fileID: 140478711}
  HUD: {fileID: 0}
